		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Created page with &amp;quot;The &amp;#039;&amp;#039;&amp;#039;Push Button Widget&amp;#039;&amp;#039;&amp;#039; displays a button with a text string.  The widget color controls the color of the text.  == Settings ==  The following settings are available specifically for Push Button Widgets.  {| {{Table}} {{Tablehead|Setting|Description}} |- {{HeadingSetting|&amp;#039;&amp;#039;&amp;#039;Push Button Settings&amp;#039;&amp;#039;&amp;#039;}} |- {{Setting|&amp;#039;&amp;#039;&amp;#039;Primary button&amp;#039;&amp;#039;&amp;#039;|Indicates that the button should be rendered with the appearance of a primary button, which causes the color of the button be...&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;New page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;The '''Push Button Widget''' displays a button with a text string.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
The widget color controls the color of the text.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
== Settings ==&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
The following settings are available specifically for Push Button Widgets.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
{| {{Table}}&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablehead|Setting|Description}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{HeadingSetting|'''Push&amp;amp;nbsp;Button&amp;amp;nbsp;Settings'''}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Primary button'''|Indicates that the button should be rendered with the appearance of a primary button, which causes the color of the button be that specified by the &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;$buttonColor&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; system variable.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Activation key'''|Specifies whether the Enter or Escape key acts as a shortcut for the push button.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Button color'''|Specifies the color of the push button if it is not a primary button.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|}&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
